                                "sense_id": "641fc1b5-24e8-3919-840a-627336d8ebc8",
                                "text": "The gentle alaunt is built exactly like a greyhound, except that he has a short, thick head."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ffbd615-01c2-477e-9800-15dcf7f834b5",
                                "sense_id": "641fc1b5-24e8-3919-840a-627336d8ebc8",
                                "text": "The alaunt was considered a reckless animal, and had been known to attack domestic animals, or even its owner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "94ec535e-8c96-4a8a-ac16-bb5ad44d10eb",
                                "sense_id": "641fc1b5-24e8-3919-840a-627336d8ebc8",
                                "text": "There was a streak through the grass, a fast-moving brindle arrow, rough-haired and uncombed. It struck the flank of the alaunt in midleap ..."
